# === Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit) ===
.env
*.env
!.env.example
# TRIP.COM DEMO EXCEPTION (owner's explicit decision, 2026-08-04): this
# PRIVATE repo ships the demo credentials so a Trip.com tester can clone and
# run with zero key entry. Rotate every credential and restore the blanket
# ignore when the demo ends. The blanket rules below still cover everything
# else.
!backend/google_adc.json
# Never commit credentials in ANY form — not even encrypted (2026-07-28).
.env.enc
*.env.enc
